{"v":2,"id":"01M8DR8VYDMB0YT71NPWYFB9QP","ts":"2026-11-27T05:39:53.93357Z","actor":"owner","type":"goal.add","node":"01M8DR8VYDMB0YT71NPWYFB9QP","payload":{"role":"owner","words":"No state or print of hyp reads git history: an act that reads it carries what it read in its event, and every state and print is calculated from events.","base":"a05b15f380efc2d0adf15fedf59d75238264c6d5","base_tree":"3c2c97d8fe34bb947673394368045feec9afa765","budget":3,"from":"","lines":[{"key":"line-1","text":"After the commits that a Goal's rows name are removed from the clone, hyp status of that Goal prints the same rows, leaves and stop as before.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-2","text":"hyp status asks git about branches only to warn that the selected commit is on no branch or tag; no state, row or stop depends on it.","kind":"guard"},{"key":"line-3","text":"The run's Leaf only and Own path guards refuse and allow the same runs as on H0.","kind":"guard"},{"key":"line-4","text":"In a clone that holds every commit, hyp status prints the same as on H0.","kind":"guard"}],"findings":["01M8DGHJZ9CTZ07M5AT5AV4WJ7"],"examples":[{"line":"line-1","example":"a","hash":"55bf4269bd96e77563a51d75f6b2897f4d4cbd33","h0":{"commit":"a05b15f380efc2d0adf15fedf59d75238264c6d5","row_tree":"3c2c97d8fe34bb947673394368045feec9afa765","probe":"b2493c40f3883ac00b4f863e99d076b814273a4b","exit":0,"verdict":"failed"},"findings":["01M8DGHJZ9CTZ07M5AT5AV4WJ7"]},{"line":"line-2","example":"a","hash":"d3a7d38121b8edfe625244fde43a685c89d0ecba","h0":{"commit":"a05b15f380efc2d0adf15fedf59d75238264c6d5","row_tree":"3c2c97d8fe34bb947673394368045feec9afa765","probe":"b2493c40f3883ac00b4f863e99d076b814273a4b","exit":0,"verdict":"met"}},{"line":"line-3","example":"a","hash":"8e2d4a215e9e5fc0ba1b703178dac51c92e6b284","h0":{"commit":"a05b15f380efc2d0adf15fedf59d75238264c6d5","row_tree":"3c2c97d8fe34bb947673394368045feec9afa765","probe":"421db8719d78e020934356a16d85233aad1e98f0","exit":0,"verdict":"met"}},{"line":"line-3","example